    CUSTOMER -->|"Register / Login / Profile\n2FA / Feedback / Chat"| P1
    CUSTOMER -->|"Booking form\npackage_ids + address + slot"| P2
    CUSTOMER -->|"View/save orders\nFeedback submission"| P3
